	"Name": "(CP) Torch Collection",
	"Author": "TeacupCreations",
	"AuthorLabel": "Teacup Creations",
	"Description": "Want light in your farm but think the vanilla torches are ugly? Have I got the solution for you!\n<br />This mod replaces the vanilla craftable torches in the game.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Current Styles\n<br />[/b]\n<br />Here are the styles currently available. You can select the colour you want using the mod config menu.\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Candle (8 Colours: White, Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Purple, Black)\n<br />[*]Oil Lamp (3 Colours: Gold, SIlver, Copper, Purple)\n<br />[*]Skull (5 Colours: White, Black, Red, Purple, Blue)\n<br />[*]Torch (2 Colours: Gold, Silver)\n<br />[/list]You can only use [b][u]ONE[/u][/b] style at a time. If you want multiple different styles, consider downloading the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/30629]Alternative Texures[/url] version.\n<br />[b]\n<br />Limitations &amp; Known Issues\n<br />\n<br />[/b][list]\n<br />[*]Due to the way torches are handled by the game, these textures change the base (ie. torch stalk) only. If you have a fire replacer mod, the torch flame will also be affected.\n<br />[*]This mod is a replacer mod and will affect [i]all[/i] torches, including those found naturally (eg. in caves)\n<br />[/list]",
